				<h2 id="security-overview-title">Choose the layer you need.</h2>
				<p class="wide">
				  Say your app sends customer invoices. Use TLS to protect the connection to your SMTP relay, DKIM to sign for your sending domain, and S/MIME or OpenPGP/MIME if the invoice itself needs protection.
				</p>
